"doi">10.1603/0022-2585(2005)042[0204:IOGVFT]2.0.CO;2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saeed</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Weaver</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Barrett</surname><given-names>ADT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Phylogeny of the Simbu serogroup of the genus Bunyavirus</article-title><source>J Gen Virol</source><year>2001</year><volume>82</volume><fpage>2173</fpage><lpage>2181</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11514727</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yanase</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kato</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamakawa</surname><given-names/></name><name><surname>Takayoshi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakamura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kokuba</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsuda</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic characterization of Batai virus indicates a genomic reassortment between orthobunyaviruses in nature</article-title><source>Arch virol</source><year>2006</year><volume>151</volume><fpage>2253</fpage><lpage>2260</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16820982</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00705-006-0808-x</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>